{"id":"5dc32170bd55a322","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-sequence-encoding.md","title":"Sequence Gödel Encoding","display":"df-sequence-encoding — Sequence Gödel Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-sequence-encoding","aliases":["90-df-sequence-encoding"],"display":"df-sequence-encoding — Sequence Gödel Encoding","depends_on":["[[58-df-omega]]","[[90-df-prime-number]]","[[90-df-divisibility]]","[[88-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-sequence-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-sequence-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence-encoding — Sequence Gödel Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0771a0b97a16ee5a\" href=\"?note=0771a0b97a16ee5a\" title=\"90-df-prime-number\">90-df-prime-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20b828a641244a9a\" href=\"?note=20b828a641244a9a\" title=\"90-df-divisibility\">90-df-divisibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0771a0b97a16ee5a\" href=\"?note=0771a0b97a16ee5a\" title=\"90-df-prime-number\">90-df-prime-number</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\">\\(\\mid\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20b828a641244a9a\" href=\"?note=20b828a641244a9a\" title=\"90-df-divisibility\">90-df-divisibility</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为集合论有限列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,s,p,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,s,p,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；乘积中的空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。数值序列编码记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle\\)</span> 在下式明确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)\\)</span>；显式函数的实参仍是集合论有限列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 直接采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a> 的公式／绑定变量模式，长度描述式的完整自由参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}},\\nu_p,(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}},\\nu_p,(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\\)</span> 是由下式图或分支引入的定义性函数词汇，不是额外待选参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}&amp;:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\prod_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}p_{i+1}^{x_i+1},\\\\\n\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n),\\qquad\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns,n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\ s=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\iota n\\,(n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\nu_p(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\max\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a\\le s\\land p^a\\mid s\\},&amp;s&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p),\\\\\n0,&amp;s=0\\lor\\neg\\operatorname{Prime}(p),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\nu_{p_{i+1}}(s)-1,&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\land i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\lor i\\ge\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}&amp;:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\prod_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}p_{i+1}^{x_i+1},\\\\\n\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n),\\qquad\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns,n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\ s=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\iota n\\,(n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\nu_p(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\max\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a\\le s\\land p^a\\mid s\\},&amp;s&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p),\\\\\n0,&amp;s=0\\lor\\neg\\operatorname{Prime}(p),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\nu_{p_{i+1}}(s)-1,&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\land i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s)\\lor i\\ge\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec y)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\vec x=\\vec y,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x))=|\\vec x|,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall i&lt;|\\vec x|\\quad\n(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x))^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i=x_i.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec y)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\vec x=\\vec y,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x))=|\\vec x|,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall i&lt;|\\vec x|\\quad\n(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\vec x))^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i=x_i.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s,n)\\)</span>、全部函数名、素数幂编码及默认值，特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_p(0)=0\">\\(\\nu_p(0)=0\\)</span>。空列编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，没有第 88 本编码的额外长度因子。非法码的长度和坐标返回零，但非法码不因此成为空列码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 只是避免有序列与编码歧义的显式别名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"0771a0b97a16ee5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-prime-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-iota-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d21